/E (Strategic Acquisitions. Exclusive Opportunities. Exceptional Property Value. At Liaison Bank, our Property Acquisition division focuses on identifying, acquiring, selling, and facilitating strategic real estate opportunities across residential, commercial, and industrial sectors. We specialise in sourcing properties through bank auctions, financial institutions, NBFCs, Asset Reconstruction Companies \(ARCs\), Non-Performing Asset \(NPA\) portfolios, and distressed asset opportunities. We connect property owners, investors, financial institutions, and businesses with the right real estate opportunities through market research, asset evaluation, transaction coordination, and strategic deal facilitation. Our focus is to identify high-potential properties, including undervalued and distressed assets, that offer attractive acquisition opportunities and long-term investment potential. From sourcing and evaluating properties to negotiating transactions, facilitating purchases, and managing leasing opportunities, we aim to make property transactions more structured, transparent, and value-driven.)
/Pg 20 0 R
/K [2]
>>
